      "displayName": "Orison Relief: Medium Supply Haul",
      "titleSource": "localized_clean",
      "titleConfidence": "high",
      "briefing": "Hey, it’s El.\n\nCrusader is still trying to make things right in Orison following the attack, so I’m hoping you’re free to keep assisting with the effort.\n\nWe been contracted to deliver relief supplies to [Destination]. Pick up’s at [Location]. \nNot too shabby a haul either, so make sure you’re in a ship that can hold [MissionMaxSCUSize] cargo containers and bring a handheld tractor beam, or you’ll make us all look unprofessional.\n\nI’m not kidding around with this job being important to get done right. Lotta people got hurt during the Nine Tails raid, and they’re relying on people like us to get them the help they need. So let’s do right by them, okay?\n\nElla Tieno \nJr. Logistics Coordinator \nCovalex Shipping   \n'Anything you need, anywhere you need it.'",
